  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1"><image src="GExpertsLogo.png" scale="100.00%" styleclass="Image Caption" figurelistinclude="0"></image></para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><image src="GExperts - Essential Logo (big G).svg" align="right" scale="33.00%" width="281" height="301" styleclass="Image Caption" figurelistinclude="0"></image></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-size:14pt; font-weight:bold;" translate="true">GExperts Version 1.3.25 </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-weight:bold;" translate="true">(Updated 2024-08-24) </text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">GExperts is a free set of tools built to increase the productivity of Delphi and C++Builder programmers by adding several features to the IDE. GExperts is developed as Open Source software and encourages user contributions to the project. </text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">GExperts would not exist without the help and advice of many people. For more </text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="Credits" styleclass="Normal" translate="true">credits</link><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true"> see the change log and commit history, or open the GExperts about box. Please take a moment to read the </text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="License_Agreement" styleclass="Normal" translate="true">GExperts License Agreement</link><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">. &#160;Also, remember that the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-weight:bold;" translate="true">Readme.txt</text><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true"> file included with GExperts will often contain information not included in this help file, including the latest changes, known bugs, and plans for the future.</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">The latest version of GExperts and the FAQ are always available at: </text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="weblink" href="https://gexperts.dummzeuch.de/" target="_blank" style="font-family:Arial; font-size:10pt; text-decoration:underline; color:#0000ff;" translate="true">https://gexperts.dummzeuch.de</link><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">. You can send bug reports and suggestions using the Feedback Wizard in the GExperts about box.</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">For other GExperts related queries use the GExperts sub-forum in Delphi Praxis at</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="weblink" href="&lt;%LINK_CAPTION%&gt;" target="_blank" styleclass="Normal" translate="true">https://en.delphipraxis.net/forum/31-gexperts/</link></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"></para>
